│ premenopausal and postmenopausal women", "abstract": "BACKGROUND To evaluate the predictive role of a risk of        │
│ malignancy index in discriminating between benign and malignant adnexal masses preoperatively. MATERIALS AND METHODS │
│ A total of 408 patients with adnexal masses managed surgically between January 2010 and February 2014 were included. │
│ The risk of malignancy indices (RMI) 1, 2, 3 and 4 were calculated using findings for ultrasonography, menopausal    │
