\"Risk of ovarian cancer in women with symptoms in primary care: population based case-control study\", \"abstract\":   
\"OBJECTIVE To identify and quantify symptoms of ovarian cancer in women in primary care. DESIGN Case-control study,    
with coding of participants\\' primary care records for one year before diagnosis. SETTING 39 general practices in      
