\"title\": \"Presurgical diagnosis of adnexal tumours using mathematical models and scoring systems: a systematic review
and meta-analysis\", \"abstract\": \"BACKGROUND Characterizing ovarian pathology is fundamental to optimizing management
in both pre- and post-menopausal women. Inappropriate referral to oncology services can lead to unnecessary surgery or 
overly radical interventions compromising fertility in young women, whilst the consequences of failing to recognize 
