  "chunk": "{\"title\": \"Menopausal status, ultrasound and biomarker tests in combination for the diagnosis of ovarian 
cancer in symptomatic women\", \"objective\": \"To establish the accuracy of combinations of menopausal status, 
ultrasound scan (USS) and biomarkers for the diagnosis of ovarian cancer in pre‐ and postmenopausal women and compare 
